# A touching ^ with a number literal is an exponent (D-1 to D-5).
== SOURCE
x^2 x^-1 x^0.5 _r^2 (a + b)^2
== TOKENS
0..1 Var(x)
1..3 Exp(2)
4..5 Var(x)
5..8 Exp(-1)
9..10 Var(x)
10..14 Exp(0.5)
15..17 LamArg(r)
17..19 Exp(2)
20..21 LParen
21..22 Var(a)
23..24 Sym(+)
25..26 Var(b)
26..27 RParen
27..29 Exp(2)
